				Hardware setup of I2C 

		R1 and R2 are external pull up resistors, usually (1K-10KΩ)

		SCL :- Used to synchronization
		SDA :- Used to exchange data 

	All I2C slaves are open-drain slaves 
	
	If the external pull up resistors are not connected then the SPI slave can write 0 value but cannot write 1 
	
	
